<title>RUSSIA: Russian RTS share index closes at record 390.82.</title>
<headline>Russian RTS share index closes at record 390.82.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System 22-share index closed up 0.47 percent on Friday at a record high of 390.82 on record market turnover of $77.3 million, the NAUFOR brokers association said.</p>
<p>The previous record was set on Thursday, when the market closed at 388.99.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
